1
00:00:01,770 --> 00:00:09,110
MONKEY ISLAND RULES

2
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:16,820
Monkey Island is an area preserving monkey species.

3
00:00:17,310 --> 00:00:28,730
Visitors coming to Monkey Island need to follow these regulations:

4
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:39,840
1. Buy admission ticket before going up island.

5
00:00:40,950 --> 00:00:50,040
2. Do not tease animals kept in cages.

6
00:00:50,240 --> 00:01:00,060
3. Do not feed animals strange food.

7
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:09,370
4. Keep general hygiene on island.

8
00:01:09,510 --> 00:01:16,680
January 15, 1990

9
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:26,930
MONKEY ISLAND TOURISM POINT MANAGEMENT BOARD

